{
  "file": "Latent",
  "page": 42,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        51.5809440612793,
        371.0941162109375,
        82.56494140625
      ],
      "text": "7.\t Issues in implementation",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 24.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        167.309814453125,
        225.42831420898438,
        184.0928192138672
      ],
      "text": "7.1\t Ethical considerations",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        190.02813720703125,
        526.6572265625,
        202.828125
      ],
      "text": "LTBI testing and treatment raise a range of ethical issues  . First, LTBI is by definition an asymptomatic  (73, 74)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8560791015625,
        204.02813720703125,
        526.6502075195312,
        216.828125
      ],
      "text": "state. This alters the ethical obligations that would be imposed by active TB. For example, the absence of an",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8560791015625,
        218.02813720703125,
        526.7211303710938,
        230.828125
      ],
      "text": "immediate risk of transmission makes it unethical to restrict migration on the basis of the LTBI status of an",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8560791015625,
        232.02813720703125,
        526.607177734375,
        244.828125
      ],
      "text": "individual. Secondly, the difficulty of accurate assessment of individual risk for the development of active TB",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8560791015625,
        246.02813720703125,
        526.6961059570312,
        258.828125
      ],
      "text": "poses a challenge to communication. Informed consent requires effective, adequate communication of the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8560791015625,
        260.02813720703125,
        526.6201782226562,
        272.828125
      ],
      "text": "uncertainty in LTBI testing, the risk for development of active TB, possible side-effects of treatment and the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8560791015625,
        274.02813720703125,
        526.626220703125,
        286.828125
      ],
      "text": "protective benefits. Risk and uncertainty must be communicated in culturally and linguistically appropriate",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8560791015625,
        288.02813720703125,
        526.6593017578125,
        300.828125
      ],
      "text": "forms and feedback obtained after screening programmes. Thirdly, LTBI disproportionately affects individuals",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8560791015625,
        302.02813720703125,
        526.6563720703125,
        314.828125
      ],
      "text": "and groups that are already socially and medically vulnerable. Therefore, efforts must be made to ensure equity",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8560791015625,
        316.02813720703125,
        526.623046875,
        328.828125
      ],
      "text": "and human rights, so that the vulnerability of target groups does not preclude their access to screening and",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8560791015625,
        330.02813720703125,
        526.6851196289062,
        342.828125
      ],
      "text": "treatment. Any intervention for vulnerable groups should include minimization of the risk for stigmatization.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8560791015625,
        344.02813720703125,
        526.67529296875,
        356.828125
      ],
      "text": "Policies should be evaluated from an ethical perspective after implementation, both to consider possible",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8560791015625,
        358.02813720703125,
        524.3960571289062,
        370.828125
      ],
      "text": "unexpected effects and to ensure that the evidence on which they are based remains current and relevant  . (75)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        385.98699951171875,
        393.8822021484375,
        402.77001953125
      ],
      "text": "7.2\t Programme management, monitoring and evaluation",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        408.7052307128906,
        526.6362915039062,
        421.5052185058594
      ],
      "text": "National programmes should prepare a national plan for programmatic LTBI management, including",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        422.7052307128906,
        526.6433715820312,
        435.5052185058594
      ],
      "text": "prioritization of groups at high risk on the basis of local epidemiology and the characteristics of the health system.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        436.7052307128906,
        526.658447265625,
        449.5052185058594
      ],
      "text": "They should create a conducive policy and programmatic environment, including national and local policies",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        450.7052307128906,
        526.6660766601562,
        463.5052185058594
      ],
      "text": "and standard operating procedures to facilitate implementation of the recommendations in these guidelines.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        464.7052307128906,
        526.6714477539062,
        477.5052185058594
      ],
      "text": "This should include promoting universal health coverage and offering public financing for LTBI management.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        478.7052307128906,
        526.6663818359375,
        491.5052185058594
      ],
      "text": "Furthermore, dedicated resources should be allocated, including for human resource development and service",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        492.7052307128906,
        526.6782836914062,
        505.5052185058594
      ],
      "text": "delivery in the community. National TB programmes should ensure meaningful engagement with affected",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        506.7052001953125,
        526.6612548828125,
        519.5051879882812
      ],
      "text": "populations, their communities, the private sector, other relevant health programmes and line ministries in",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        520.7052001953125,
        526.7155151367188,
        533.5051879882812
      ],
      "text": "both planning and implementing the interventions. The national TB programme is also encouraged to ensure",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        534.7052001953125,
        526.6812744140625,
        547.5051879882812
      ],
      "text": "access to comprehensive care for co-existing risk factors for TB, such as diabetes, undernutrition and tobacco",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        548.7052001953125,
        110.69811248779297,
        561.5051879882812
      ],
      "text": "smoking.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        568.375244140625,
        526.7153930664062,
        581.1752319335938
      ],
      "text": "Preventive TB treatment for people living with HIV should be a core component of HIV preventive care and",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        582.375244140625,
        526.7201538085938,
        595.1752319335938
      ],
      "text": "should be the responsibility of national AIDS programmes and HIV service providers. Preventive treatment",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        596.375244140625,
        505.0434265136719,
        609.1752319335938
      ],
      "text": "should not be viewed as an isolated intervention but should be part of a comprehensive package of care.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        616.0452270507812,
        526.7191772460938,
        628.84521484375
      ],
      "text": "Coverage of contact investigation and treatment of LTBI among child contacts and people living with HIV",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        630.0452270507812,
        526.6481323242188,
        642.84521484375
      ],
      "text": "are among the top 10 core indicators for monitoring implementation of the End TB Strategy. Programmatic",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        644.0452270507812,
        526.6710815429688,
        656.84521484375
      ],
      "text": "management of LTBI should include monitoring and evaluation systems that are aligned with national patient",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        658.0452270507812,
        526.7044067382812,
        670.84521484375
      ],
      "text": "monitoring and surveillance systems  . Appropriate recording and reporting tools should be developed, and  (76)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        176.96609497070312,
        671.9852294921875,
        209.28909301757812,
        684.9152221679688
      ],
      "text": "Table 3",
      "font": "Whitney-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        672.0452270507812,
        526.6961669921875,
        684.84521484375
      ],
      "text": "standardized indicators ( ) should be measured to regularly inform decision-making for programme",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        686.0452270507812,
        526.696044921875,
        698.84521484375
      ],
      "text": "implementation. Some may require changes to national legislation (e.g. making LTBI a notifiable condition)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        700.0452270507812,
        526.6661987304688,
        712.84521484375
      ],
      "text": "and to the policy framework, which should be addressed according to the local and national context. It is",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        714.0452270507812,
        526.6473388671875,
        726.84521484375
      ],
      "text": "important to engage the private health sector and to ensure proper recording and reporting from both the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        728.0452270507812,
        526.670166015625,
        740.84521484375
      ],
      "text": "private and public sectors. Use of electronic case-based monitoring will facilitate recording and reporting for",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        742.0452270507812,
        151.0341033935547,
        754.84521484375
      ],
      "text": "LTBI management.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        38.4452018737793,
        790.2608032226562,
        56.693206787109375,
        810.61279296875
      ],
      "text": "30",
      "font": "Whitney-Light",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        796.524658203125,
        458.3740539550781,
        805.5686645507812
      ],
      "text": "LATENT TUBERCULOSIS INFECTION: UPDATED AND CONSOLIDATED GUIDELINES FOR PROGRAMMATIC MANAGEMENT",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}